<ol class="list-none print:block lg:grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(180px,1fr))] gap-rg">
  <li id="step_65014172" class="step mb-rg flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-sm print:flex-row print:gap-0" data-collapse-recipe-target="step">
  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 mr-sm">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col place-content-center place-items-center text-cookpad-14 print:text-cookpad-body-16 text-cookpad-gray-100 bg-cookpad-gray-700 w-6 h-6 rounded-full print:font-semibold print:text-cookpad-gray-700 print:bg-transparent"
      aria-label="作り方1">
      1
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full grid gap-sm">
    <div dir="auto">
      <p class="last:mb-0 mb-sm overflow-wrap-anywhere">鶏モモ肉 は一口大に、 玉ねぎ は薄切り(orみじん切り)にします♪</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</li>
<li id="step_65014173" class="step mb-rg flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-sm print:flex-row print:gap-0" data-collapse-recipe-target="step">
  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 mr-sm">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col place-content-center place-items-center text-cookpad-14 print:text-cookpad-body-16 text-cookpad-gray-100 bg-cookpad-gray-700 w-6 h-6 rounded-full print:font-semibold print:text-cookpad-gray-700 print:bg-transparent"
      aria-label="作り方2">
      2
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full grid gap-sm">
    <div dir="auto">
      <p class="last:mb-0 mb-sm overflow-wrap-anywhere">フライパンに バター(大さじ2) を熱し、鶏肉 に 塩胡椒 をふり表面をこんがり焼きます♪</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</li>
<li id="step_65014174" class="step mb-rg flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-sm print:flex-row print:gap-0" data-collapse-recipe-target="step">
  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 mr-sm">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col place-content-center place-items-center text-cookpad-14 print:text-cookpad-body-16 text-cookpad-gray-100 bg-cookpad-gray-700 w-6 h-6 rounded-full print:font-semibold print:text-cookpad-gray-700 print:bg-transparent"
      aria-label="作り方3">
      3
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full grid gap-sm">
    <div dir="auto">
      <p class="last:mb-0 mb-sm overflow-wrap-anywhere">お鍋に バター(大さじ3) にんにくチューブ 生姜チューブ 玉ねぎ を入れてあめ色になるまでじっくり炒めます♪</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</li>
<li id="step_65014175" class="step mb-rg flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-sm print:flex-row print:gap-0" data-collapse-recipe-target="step">
  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 mr-sm">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col place-content-center place-items-center text-cookpad-14 print:text-cookpad-body-16 text-cookpad-gray-100 bg-cookpad-gray-700 w-6 h-6 rounded-full print:font-semibold print:text-cookpad-gray-700 print:bg-transparent"
      aria-label="作り方4">
      4
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full grid gap-sm">
    <div dir="auto">
      <p class="last:mb-0 mb-sm overflow-wrap-anywhere">カレー粉 を加えて弱火で3分くらい炒めます♪</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</li>
<li id="step_65014176" class="step mb-rg flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-sm print:flex-row print:gap-0" data-collapse-recipe-target="step">
  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 mr-sm">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col place-content-center place-items-center text-cookpad-14 print:text-cookpad-body-16 text-cookpad-gray-100 bg-cookpad-gray-700 w-6 h-6 rounded-full print:font-semibold print:text-cookpad-gray-700 print:bg-transparent"
      aria-label="作り方5">
      5
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full grid gap-sm">
    <div dir="auto">
      <p class="last:mb-0 mb-sm overflow-wrap-anywhere">＊ と 鶏肉(油分も) を加えて沸騰したら火が通るまで(10分程)煮ます♪</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</li>
<li id="step_65014177" class="step mb-rg flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-sm print:flex-row print:gap-0" data-collapse-recipe-target="step">
  <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 mr-sm">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col place-content-center place-items-center text-cookpad-14 print:text-cookpad-body-16 text-cookpad-gray-100 bg-cookpad-gray-700 w-6 h-6 rounded-full print:font-semibold print:text-cookpad-gray-700 print:bg-transparent"
      aria-label="作り方6">
      6
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-full grid gap-sm print:grid-cols-[1fr_calc(100%/3)]">
    <div dir="auto">
      <p class="last:mb-0 mb-sm overflow-wrap-anywhere">仕上げに 生クリーム を加えて混ぜ、温まったらすぐ火を止めます♪
<br>完成♡♡
<br>更に仕上げに生クリームをトッピングしました♡</p>
    </div>

